    "restaurantTitle": "The meeting point of flavors, scents, and music.",
    "restaurantDescription": "Located in Belgrade’s Gastrošor district, the city’s first regional gastro-park, Tannin Wine Bistro has become an essential destination for lovers of good atmosphere, wine, and quality food. With more than 300 carefully selected labels, this spot offers a true journey through the vineyards of Serbia, the Balkans, and the world, with a selection that can satisfy the full spectrum of wine enthusiasts—from seasoned connoisseurs to those just discovering the world of wine. The Tannin team knows well how important the energy of a space is, so the venue’s naturally laid-back atmosphere is enhanced on weekends with positive vibes from the resident DJ. Tannin’s garden is a true corner of pure hedonism—whether you’re sharing a plate of food, exploring new wine pairings through promotional events and tastings, or enjoying a cocktail while taking in the view and the greenery.",
